Package: azureops
Title: Interface with the Azure DevOps REST API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Matt", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "matt@example.com")
Description: Programmatically interface with the Azure DevOps REST API for querying 
    resources and triggering automated workflows across Azure Boards, Repos, 
    Pipelines, Test Plans, and Administration using 'httr2' and 'S7'.
